# A1 joins "such Interpretation" (commentary that explains a text) to "the Interpreter" (the one whose reading settles what the law means).
# These are two different claims, each in its own sense. The step is the text's own reasoning: endless commentary cannot settle the meaning, so the commentator is not the authoritative interpreter.
# So A1 is not a bridge between two senses of one word.
